{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52367","headline":"回波乐 十 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"但令但贪但呼，波（陈校作「般」）若法水不枯。\n醉时安眠大道，谁能向我停居。\n八苦变成甘露，解脱更欲何须。\n万法归依一相，安然独坐四衢。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52367.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52367","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}